to-be-incorporated-into-paper-lines-24 : List (List Word)
to-be-incorporated-into-paper-lines-24 = cons "- **Decomposition.** A decomposition process, today a language model, takes a unit and gives a new" (cons "  unit: a collection of smaller units, at the level of single assertions and their evidence, which" (cons "  together are asserted to carry the same meaning as the original. There are then two units, the" (cons "  essay bare and the essay decomposed, and the assertion of their semantic equivalence relates them." (cons "  The decomposed unit carries internal structure; the bare one does not." nil))))
